            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The exchanges of the train manufacturing are derived from an assessment of the "Kolibri", a regional train which is currently used for regional transportation in Switzerland .The life span of the train  is assumed to be 40 years resulting in a life time performance of  6’000’000 vkm.  Total weight of the train is about 171t. The dominating material is steel.;
