        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">In 2000 the modelled train dominates the regional transport in Switzerland. However, in the near future new trains will be in operation, which are characterised by a substitution of steel with aluminium.\n\n# Included processes\nThis inventory calls processes of material production, representing the material composition of a standard Swiss Regional Train (Kolibri). For manufacturing, electricity and light oil burned in industrial furnace are included. For the transportation of materials standard distance are applied.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
